{"parentUuid":"a552c753-3df4-42b7-b9ab-a901333bfac9","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"f0f84a0e-4c6b-477d-b108-91595b1d1f81","agentId":"a3d9a94747dce8021","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01JhbeQ24J5MsRbFNPpKCupP","type":"tool_result","content":"\"\"\"The only module in CUORE that imports :mod:`mes.known_good`.\n\nMirrors the pattern ``mes_bridge.py`` and ``service_bridge.py`` already use:\nevery route (and, here, the built-in gauge layouts) reaches the known-good\nreference bands and this car's own MES-observed ranges only through this\n90:def list_logs(*, kind: str = \"\", vehicle: str = \"\", vin: str = \"\",\n529:def dealer_results(vin: str) -> dict[str, Any]:\n551:def notes(vin: str, target_kind: str = \"\", target_id: str = \"\") -> dict[str, Any]:\n632:def list_recordings() -> dict[str, Any]:","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"d3ce80a1-2afc-4545-b2a8-c6fdc919d47b","timestamp":"2026-10-08T01:26:27.312Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"\"\"\"The only module in CUORE that imports :mod:`mes.known_good`.\n\nMirrors the pattern ``mes_bridge.py`` and ``service_bridge.py`` already use:\nevery route (and, here, the built-in gauge layouts) reaches the known-good\nreference bands and this car's own MES-observed ranges only through this\n90:def list_logs(*, kind: str = \"\", vehicle: str = \"\", vin: str = \"\",\n529:def dealer_results(vin: str) -> dict[str, Any]:\n551:def notes(vin: str, target_kind: str = \"\", target_id: str = \"\") -> dict[str, Any]:\n632:def list_recordings() -> dict[str, Any]:","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"f08b0a88-a4d3-4ce7-8f31-6037b5615ef4","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"/c/Users/User/mcp-servers","root":null,"branch":null,"default_branch":null,"status":null,"visibility":null,"error":"pending"},"live_cwd":"/c/Users/User/mcp-servers","platform":"windows"}},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"a552c753-3df4-42b7-b9ab-a901333bfac9","userType":"external